   "author": "Bill",
   "date": "2021-11-04T20:05:09",
   "content_html": "<p>Great article, Matti. I followed your plan for 13 weeks, was fitter than I’ve been in 20 years, met awesome people in training and in Emporia, and finished in……17hrs! Hardest physical activity I’ve ever done and I’ve finished multiple marathons in wicked heat. Every anecdote and recommendation in here is spot on. This is a must ride…</p>\n"
  }
